{"q":"149","t":"Max Points on a Line","d":"Hard","p":false,"c":"<p>Given an array of <code>points</code> where <code>points[i] = [x<sub>i</sub>, y<sub>i</sub>]</code> represents a point on the <strong>X-Y</strong> plane, return <em>the maximum number of points that lie on the same straight line</em>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/f2f9fe06da673635.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 294px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> points = [[1,1],[2,2],[3,3]]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 3\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/21cc4c3913e57340.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 294px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> points = [[1,1],[3,2],[5,3],[4,1],[2,3],[1,4]]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 4\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= points.length &lt;= 300</code></li>\n\t<li><code>points[i].length == 2</code></li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>4</sup> &lt;= x<sub>i</sub>, y<sub>i</sub> &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li>All the <code>points</code> are <strong>unique</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"maxPoints\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"points\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer[][]\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Hash Table","slug":"hash-table"},{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"Geometry","slug":"geometry"},{"name":"Euclidean Algorithm","slug":"euclidean-algorithm"},{"name":"Greatest Common Divisor","slug":"greatest-common-divisor"}],"s":[{"t":"Line Reflection","s":"line-reflection","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Minimum Number of Lines to Cover Points","s":"minimum-number-of-lines-to-cover-points","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Minimum Lines to Represent a Line Chart","s":"minimum-lines-to-represent-a-line-chart","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Count Special Subsequences","s":"count-special-subsequences","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["LinkedIn","linkedin"],["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Meta","facebook"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Cisco","cisco"],["Sprinklr","sprinklr"],["Waymo","waymo"],["Zoox","zoox"],["Apple","apple"],["X","twitter"]],"cs":{"a":[["Bloomberg","bloomberg",2]],"b":[["Amazon","amazon",2]],"m":[["Google","google",15],["Meta","facebook",11],["Waymo","waymo",11],["LinkedIn","linkedin",6],["Cisco","cisco",5],["Microsoft","microsoft",4],["Zoho","zoho",2],["Citadel","citadel",2],["Nvidia","nvidia",2],["Meesho","meesho",2]]}}